WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:04.947
A useful recommendation can remain conditional You have identified

00:00:04.999 --> 00:00:09.868
the conflict Next compare the options without pretending a

00:00:09.921 --> 00:00:13.395
decision has been made An assistant may want to

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.013
say everything is arranged so that others can move

00:00:16.066 --> 00:00:19.750
on If another owner has not accepted the work

00:00:20.158 --> 00:00:24.697
that reassurance is misleading We will compare workable options

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.421
and make their outstanding conditions explicit
